{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788297070917,"sessionID":"ses_fa130e14bffeHOCZtybDeHH22K","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-9e4aa1f35191e945","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"gh issue view 171"},"output":"title:\tDesign: minimal HTTP query sugar for toylang stdlib\nstate:\tOPEN\nauthor:\tkantord (Dániel Kántor)\nlabels:\t\ncomments:\t0\nassignees:\t\nprojects:\t\nmilestone:\t\nissue-type:\t\nparent:\t\nsub-issues:\t\nsub-issues-completed:\t\nblocked-by:\t\nblocking:\t\nnumber:\t171\n--\nMaintainer note (composed 2026-08-31T22:08): think about the best way to add simple HTTP query support (like Python's `requests`) with minimal complexity, as sugar over whatever backend already provides.\n\nNeeds a grilling round before it becomes build work: what's the minimal surface (get/post? headers? body?), which backend(s) it targets, and how it composes with the existing sink/source vocabulary.\n","metadata":{"output":"title:\tDesign: minimal HTTP query sugar for toylang stdlib\nstate:\tOPEN\nauthor:\tkantord (Dániel Kántor)\nlabels:\t\ncomments:\t0\nassignees:\t\nprojects:\t\nmilestone:\t\nissue-type:\t\nparent:\t\nsub-issues:\t\nsub-issues-completed:\t\nblocked-by:\t\nblocking:\t\nnumber:\t171\n--\nMaintainer note (composed 2026-08-31T22:08): think about the best way to add simple HTTP query support (like Python's `requests`) with minimal complexity, as sugar over whatever backend already provides.\n\nNeeds a grilling round before it becomes build work: what's the minimal surface (get/post? headers? body?), which backend(s) it targets, and how it composes with the existing sink/source vocabulary.\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"gh issue view 171","time":{"start":1788297070900,"end":1788297070911}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_05ecfc1e6001lqTUUhAJaUM4Rm","sessionID":"ses_fa130e14bffeHOCZtybDeHH22K","messageID":"msg_05ecf4371001ybAKrEwawG17JW"}}
